WEBVTT

00:03:28.097 --> 00:03:30.597
and business people started
to use this more

00:03:30.597 --> 00:03:32.930
and more to sketch out
their business ideas.

00:03:33.497 --> 00:03:38.130
But one of the things we've noticed is
that too many people were still stuck

00:03:38.463 --> 00:03:40.963
in technology, innovation
and product thinking.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:47.997
So we created an entire library of
business model patterns inspired by

00:03:47.997 --> 00:03:49.830
the world's best business models,

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:54.230
inspiration from entrepreneurs
like Martha Matilda Harper.

00:03:55.163 --> 00:03:56.797
But you've got to be careful,

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.630
because when you sketch out a
great businessman on paper,